## Tokens

Create `src/styles/tokens.css` and import once in `main.tsx`. Every colour reference in the app is a `var()`.

```css
:root {
  color-scheme: light;

  /* ground */
  --paper:      #EEF1F4;
  --surface:    #FFFFFF;
  --surface-2:  #F7F9FB;
  --ink:        #14161C;
  --ink-muted:  #5C6470;
  --ink-faint:  #8A9099;
  --hairline:   #D5DBE2;
  --hairline-strong: #B9C2CC;

  /* semantic */
  --flow:       #2F6F6B;
  --flow-weak:  #DCE9E8;
  --inbound:    #3A7D5C;
  --outbound:   #8E4A34;
  --signal:     #A33049;
  --signal-weak:#F5DEE3;
  --caution:    #B0842A;
  --neutral:    #7A7F87;

  /* category ramp - mineral, deliberately not a rainbow */
  --cat-1: #A9694F; --cat-2: #6B7F4E; --cat-3: #4A6A8A; --cat-4: #6E4A63;
  --cat-5: #B0842A; --cat-6: #2F6F6B; --cat-7: #8E4A34; --cat-8: #7A7F87;

  /* type scale - the only sizes permitted */
  --t-micro: 12px; --t-small: 14px; --t-body: 16px;
  --t-lead: 20px;  --t-sub: 28px;   --t-figure: 44px; --t-hero: 64px;

  /* spacing - the only values permitted */
  --s-1: 4px; --s-2: 8px; --s-3: 12px; --s-4: 16px;
  --s-6: 24px; --s-8: 32px; --s-12: 48px;

  --r-sm: 4px; --r-md: 8px; --r-lg: 14px; --r-full: 999px;

  /* one shadow, used sparingly, for floating surfaces only */
  --lift: 0 8px 24px -8px rgb(20 22 28 / 0.18);
}

[data-theme="dark"] {
  color-scheme: dark;
  --paper: #101317; --surface: #171B21; --surface-2: #1E232A;
  --ink: #E8ECF1; --ink-muted: #98A1AC; --ink-faint: #6B747E;
  --hairline: #2A3138; --hairline-strong: #3A424B;
  --flow-weak: #1C2E2D; --signal-weak: #2E1A20;
  /* category ramp lifted ~10% lightness */
  --cat-1: #C4826A; --cat-2: #869C66; --cat-3: #6688A8; --cat-4: #8B6480;
  --cat-5: #CBA047; --cat-6: #479E99; --cat-7: #AB6349; --cat-8: #969BA3;
}
```

Wire into Tailwind v4 with `@theme` so `bg-surface`, `text-ink-muted`, `p-4` map to these and nothing else is reachable.

