## Self-check before finishing a screen

Answer these honestly. If any answer is no, fix it before moving on.

1. Is there exactly one element on this screen that is obviously the most important?
2. Does every colour on screen encode a category or a state?
3. Could you delete any border, shadow, or divider and lose nothing?
4. Do all the numbers align on the decimal?
5. Does it work at 380px wide without horizontal scroll?
6. Are all interactive targets at least 44px?
